            "review_title": "Review at The ArcanStone",
            "review_text": "Kamila P\nRzeszow, Poland20 contributions\n0\nMUSSELS AND FRENCH FRIES\nNov 2018 • Couples\nWe finally found cool place close by to eat some Mussels, on the pictures we saw looked delicious, like the one we ate in France.....\nWe came in, asked the weitress if mussels come with french fries, she went to ask the cook, came back, said no...\nOk, so we ordered 2times 500gr mussels and 1x french fries and 1 juice....\nAfter few minutes she said they do not have mussels at all and she brought juice..... And waiting for french fries.... And waiting... And waiting....... We downed the juice and assumed that the probably also do not have french fries, just the wild guess:), so we asked for a check :)\nWell thanks a lot!\nGive it 3 stars only for the restaurant design cool vibe music dj\nRead more\nWritten November 30, 2018",
            "rating": 5.0,
