            "review_title": "Review at The ArcanStone",
            "review_text": "Malika F\n3 contributions\n0\nA place for any mood!\nJul 2018 • Friends\nThe ArcanStone has a very special ambience. They have events and happenings for all kinds of people - but they are all about community and the people! It somehow manages to be both chill out in the pool, amazing and interesting documentaries, and a little bit of dancing with the live dj's for podcasts - but no matter for what event or what day you come, you know you are going to be welcomed by the people there, and it is guaranteed that you will feel at home. \n\nThere is no place like this in Saigon, and if you haven't been here yet, you are missing out!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 2, 2018",
